# Netlify SPA Redirect Rules — GoldFlow NFC
# Rotas permanentes para QR Codes e Placas NFC
/q/:id    /index.html   200!
/qr/:id   /index.html   200!
/r/:id    /index.html   200!

# Wildcards para sub-rotas e barras finais (ex: /q/kao/ ou /q/kao?fbclid=...)
/q/*      /index.html   200!
/qr/*     /index.html   200!
/r/*      /index.html   200!

# SPA catch-all rewrite
/*        /index.html   200
